OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Ffurther showers over western hills
OL,7,Fthis evening and overnight. Elsewhere,
OL,8,Fit will be mostly dry with clear
OL,9,Fspells. Winds easing to become light
OL,10,Finland, but it will remain breezy near
OL,11,Fthe coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FStaying cloudy with the odd
OL,14,Flight shower over western hills
OL,15,Fhowever elsewhere will be mostly dry
OL,16,Fwith bright or sunny spells. Moderate
OL,17,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
