OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,7,Ftemperatures than of late as showers
OL,8,For longer spells of rain move through,
OL,9,Finterspersed with brighter, drier
OL,10,Finterludes. Often breezy, with
OL,11,Foccasionally strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
